              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Samweli akatwaa jiwe, na kulisimamisha kati ya Mispa na Sheni, akaliita jina lake Eben-ezeri, akisema, Hata sasa BWANA ametusaidia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
